WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.862
Lab 1.

2
00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:02.138
Eight tests pass.

3
00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:05.401
Then export October's
five fictional findings.

4
00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:09.100
Four closed on a re-read, and
one is a declared exception.

5
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.138
Two of three judged closures
were inside the window.

6
00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:15.094
Then the problems, by
name: one closed late,

7
00:00:15.094 --> 00:00:20.486
one whose evidence no longer matches
its hash, and one closed with no re-read

8
00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:23.704
evidence at all; its
close note just says done,

9
00:00:23.704 --> 00:00:26.487
which Book 13 calls prose, not evidence.

10
00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:30.951
The command exits with a failure rather
than producing a clean-looking package.

11
00:00:30.951 --> 00:00:32.900
The last line is the chain's head.
